---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Colophon" description="How this site was made.">
  <article class="prose">
    <p class="kicker mono">colophon</p>
    <h1>How this site was made.</h1>

    <dl>
      <dt>Stack</dt>
      <dd><a class="link" href="https://astro.build" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Astro</a> · TypeScript · zero JS frameworks by default</dd>

      <dt>Type</dt>
      <dd><a class="link" href="https://vercel.com/font" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Geist Sans</a> for body, Geist Mono for code and tags. Self-hosted.</dd>

      <dt>Color</dt>
      <dd>One accent — electric cobalt — against a paper or ink background depending on your OS.</dd>

      <dt>Hosting</dt>
      <dd>Vercel.</dd>

      <dt>Source</dt>
      <dd><a class="link" href="https://github.com/joshuacardozo1994" target="_blank" rel="noopener">github.com/joshuacardozo1994</a></dd>

      <dt>Anti-features</dt>
      <dd>No newsletter popup. No cookie banner. No skill bars. No testimonials. No analytics yet — maybe never.</dd>

      <dt>Easter eggs</dt>
      <dd>Press <kbd>?</kbd> for jump-to. View source for a small note. <a class="link" href="/humans.txt">/humans.txt</a> exists.</dd>
    </dl>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .prose { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem; }
  .kicker { font-size: 0.78rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: var(--fg-faint); }
  h1 { margin-block: 0.4rem 1.2rem; }
  dl { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 8rem 1fr; gap: 0.6rem 1.2rem; margin: 0; }
  dt { color: var(--fg-faint); font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.8rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; padding-top: 0.15rem; }
  dd { margin: 0; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.55; }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    dl { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 0.2rem 0; }
    dd { margin-bottom: 0.8rem; }
  }
</style>
